#: ../../../install_osx.md:1
msgid "Binary Installation on MacOS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:3
msgid ""
"All the Garden binaries are available in Catalina and BigSur using the "
"[homebrew package manager](https://brew.sh/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:6
msgid "The homebrew tool can be installed using:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:8
msgid ""
"/bin/bash -c \"$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/"
"install/master/install.sh)\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:12
msgid ""
"After installing the homebrew package manager, Gazebo Gadrden can be "
"installed running:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:14
msgid ""
"brew tap osrf/simulation\n"
"brew trust osrf/simulation\n"
"brew install gz-garden\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:20
msgid ""
"All libraries should be ready to use and the `gz sim -s` server app ready to "
"be executed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:22
msgid ""
"Head back to the [Getting started](getstarted) page to start using Gazebo!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:25
msgid "Uninstalling binary install"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:27
msgid ""
"If you need to uninstall Gazebo or switch to a source-based install once you "
"have already installed the library from binaries, run the following command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:30
msgid "brew uninstall gz-garden\n"
msgstr ""

